# Deploy

- Production is four processes: web (nginx), api (FastAPI), worker (Celery), beat (Celery). Plus Postgres, Redis, S3-compatible storage.
- Exactly one beat replica. Never `AUTO_MIGRATE=true` in production.
- Web is the only public surface. It proxies `/v1` and `/health` to the API so cookies stay first-party.
- `WEB_ORIGIN` is the public HTTPS origin of web. `TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS=1` behind one edge proxy.
- Templates live under `infra/deploy/`. Document new env vars in `.env.example` and `docs/`.
